{"work_id": "MX4-002", "matched_key": "蒋介石在挑动内战", "normalized_offset": 1100, "normalized_context": "以党派代表的身份参加国民参政会国民党政府一九三八年四月颁布的国民参政会组织条例第三条中规定曾在各重要文化团体或经济团体服务三年以上著有信望或努力国事信望久著之人员得为国民参政会参政员当时国民党就是按照这项规定指定了中国共产党的参政员9见本卷蒋介石在挑动内战10白晋指当时山西省东南部由祁县的白圭到晋城的一条未完成的铁路9142480", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "book_title_marks", "witness_id": "A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86.pdf", "raw_sha256": "e65195a022c0a066d8bbcf68fcf452a764f7f759019331cf153dadd16233d242", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mirror-combined-unverified", "volume": null, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 914, "end": 914, "record_path": "archive/records/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "source_bytes_verified_imprint_images_available_for_review", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-26b2b856138f61dd", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX4-002", "matched_key": "蒋介石在挑动内战", "normalized_offset": 207, "normalized_context": "积极准备反革命内战毛泽东写第一个电报的目的就在于揭露蒋介石的反革命面目教育全国人民警惕蒋介石的内战阴谋在第二个电报里进一步揭穿了蒋介石集团准备内战的阴谋并提出了中国共产党关于制止内战的六项主张为着同样的目的毛泽东还为新华社写了两篇评论即本卷蒋介石在挑动内战和评蒋介石发言人谈话由于中国共产党采取了这种决不被蒋介石的反动气焰所吓倒的坚定的果断的立场就使解放区和解放军得到了迅速的扩大并且使蒋介石在国内外反对中国内战的强大政治压力之下不得不改变策略装出和平姿态邀请毛泽东到重庆举行和平谈判1见本卷蒋介石在挑动内战注12见本卷蒋介石在挑动内战注23热河察哈尔见本卷抗日战争胜利后的时局和我们的方针注11绥远原来也是一个省一九五四年撤销原辖地区划归内蒙古自治区4十九个大块的解放区指陕甘宁晋绥晋察冀冀热辽晋冀豫冀鲁豫山东苏北", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "book_title_marks", "witness_id": "A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86.pdf", "raw_sha256": "e65195a022c0a066d8bbcf68fcf452a764f7f759019331cf153dadd16233d242", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mirror-combined-unverified", "volume": null, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 923, "end": 923, "record_path": "archive/records/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "source_bytes_verified_imprint_images_available_for_review", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-259719bbdf75249e", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
